  "plan": {
    "goal": "Extrude bioink through a cryo-2 (410 µm) nozzle along a 30576 µm G-code path at 21.39 mm/min to fill a 37366 µm footprint at 268 µm line pitch, and report print time, extruded volume, deposition rate, fill-line count and filament mass.",
    "rationale": "Pure bioprinting sizing calculation. The G-code path length (30576 µm) and nozzle diameter (410 µm) define the extruded ink volume as a cylinder (V = π(d/2)²·L). Print time follows from path length ÷ feed rate. Deposition rate is volume ÷ time. Fill lines = ⌈footprint width / line pitch⌉. Filament mass = volume × ink density (1.132 g/cm³). All values are computed by the calculators from the stated raw inputs.",
